commit 51ca8fcd6339eef29010c70bbcb5f9c00f29375a
Author: blokyk <courvoisier.zoe@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon May 18 17:02:58 2026 +0200

    fetchTarball: report progress of tarball unpacking
    
    this logs unpackTarball calls as `actFileTransfer` activity, and reports
    the amount of extracted bytes. i didn't make a new ActivityType because,
    from what i understand, that would be a breaking change for the daemon
    protocol.
    
    note that since computing the amount of uncompressed data is non-trivial,
    this CL doesn't attempt to contrast the in-progress amount vs the
    expected amount; this is still better than nothing, which is what we do
    right now.
    
    also ArchiveDecompressionSource apparently does its own custom
    decompression without using unpackTarball, but i'm honestly not sure
    where and how that class is actually used, so i didn't touch it.
    
    Fixes #1213
    
    Change-Id: I68f3be520681d8889292353dd41ab19a60c5eeea

